      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LITTLE FLOWER (1) made light work of a wide draw last time with a slick early sectional but gathered in and had to settle for the minors, finishing second (26.07) at this track over 460m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Likely to feature again. OKLAHOMA BALE (2) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 2.5 lengths fourth (23.68) over 410m at Horsham. Has ability and can measure up. ELEVATE (8) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten a neck into second (25.84) at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 450m. Well placed and gets his chance. VOLTAGE STRIKE (6) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
